  sequence:
  - character: 24
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Dahlia
    content:
    - Now that you two are here, I can talk to you about our friend here.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - What did you want to discuss, Guildmaster Dahlia?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Yeah, what's the deal?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 24
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Dahlia
    content:
    - Well, you know how it's Fern's first day around the area, right?
    - You two were the ones that brought him in, after all.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 23
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Fern
    content:
    - H-hey... Uh... It's great seeing you guys again.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 24
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Dahlia
    content:
    - See, I was thinking, since you two haven't been around for very long either,
      how about you show our new member the ropes?
    - Fern has expressed a great interest in becoming an adventurer just like you
      two.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - It'll be our pleasure, Madam Dahlia.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Ooh, a little guild orientation? Sounds fun!
    - Oh my... Fern, now that you're a member of our guild, it looks like you've
      come so far!
    - To think that just last week, you were a lowly thief trying to steal my wallet.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 23
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Uh, yeah, hahah...
    - Well, I'm happy to be in your hands...
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 24
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Wonderful! I'm sure the three of you will get along well.
    - Now, I must return to my guildmaster duties. I'm counting on you two to show
      our new friend around.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 1
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Sure thing, 'Lia!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - You can count on us.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
